{"total": 46.686, "lines": [{"cap": "During World War Two, the US almost let pigeons pilot bombs.", "start": 0.36, "end": 4.206, "audio_at": 0.3, "dur": 4.086125, "words": [{"text": "During", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.588}, {"text": "World", "start": 0.6, "end": 0.829}, {"text": "War", "start": 0.841, "end": 1.057}, {"text": "Two", "start": 1.069, "end": 1.43}, {"text": "the", "start": 1.718, "end": 1.79}, {"text": "US", "start": 1.802, "end": 2.283}, {"text": "almost", "start": 2.403, "end": 2.776}, {"text": "let", "start": 2.788, "end": 2.944}, {"text": "pigeons", "start": 2.956, "end": 3.365}, {"text": "pilot", "start": 3.377, "end": 3.725}, {"text": "bombs", "start": 3.737, "end": 4.206}]}, {"cap": "Seriously.", "start": 4.826, "end": 5.355, "audio_at": 4.766, "dur": 0.768833, "words": [{"text": "Seriously", "start": 4.826, "end": 5.355}]}, {"cap": "A psychologist named B. F. Skinner trained pigeons to peck at the image of a ship on a tiny screen.", "start": 5.975, "end": 12.177, "audio_at": 5.915, "dur": 6.441917, "words": [{"text": "A", "start": 5.975, "end": 6.011}, {"text": "psychologist", "start": 6.023, "end": 6.78}, {"text": "named", "start": 6.792, "end": 7.117}, {"text": "B", "start": 7.129, "end": 7.429}, {"text": "F", "start": 7.934, "end": 8.259}, {"text": "Skinner", "start": 8.571, "end": 8.932}, {"text": "trained", "start": 8.944, "end": 9.316}, {"text": "pigeons", "start": 9.328, "end": 9.701}, {"text": "to", "start": 9.713, "end": 9.809}, {"text": "peck", "start": 9.821, "end": 10.098}, {"text": "at", "start": 10.11, "end": 10.17}, {"text": "the", "start": 10.182, "end": 10.29}, {"text": "image", "start": 10.338, "end": 10.626}, {"text": "of", "start": 10.638, "end": 10.698}, {"text": "a", "start": 10.711, "end": 10.747}, {"text": "ship", "start": 10.759, "end": 11.131}, {"text": "on", "start": 11.287, "end": 11.396}, {"text": "a", "start": 11.408, "end": 11.456}, {"text": "tiny", "start": 11.468, "end": 11.768}, {"text": "screen", "start": 11.78, "end": 12.177}]}, {"cap": "Every peck steered the bomb: left, right.", "start": 12.697, "end": 15.101, "audio_at": 12.637, "dur": 2.643833, "words": [{"text": "Every", "start": 12.697, "end": 12.937}, {"text": "peck", "start": 12.949, "end": 13.262}, {"text": "steered", "start": 13.274, "end": 13.682}, {"text": "the", "start": 13.694, "end": 13.767}, {"text": "bomb", "start": 13.779, "end": 14.091}, {"text": "left", "start": 14.488, "end": 14.812}, {"text": "right", "start": 14.848, "end": 15.101}]}, {"cap": "And to avoid mistakes, each bomb carried three pigeons. They decided by vote.", "start": 15.621, "end": 20.272, "audio_at": 15.561, "dur": 4.891417, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 15.621, "end": 15.693}, {"text": "to", "start": 15.705, "end": 15.849}, {"text": "avoid", "start": 15.861, "end": 16.186}, {"text": "mistakes", "start": 16.198, "end": 16.763}, {"text": "each", "start": 17.123, "end": 17.303}, {"text": "bomb", "start": 17.315, "end": 17.652}, {"text": "carried", "start": 17.664, "end": 18.025}, {"text": "three", "start": 18.037, "end": 18.313}, {"text": "pigeons", "start": 18.325, "end": 18.89}, {"text": "They", "start": 19.299, "end": 19.347}, {"text": "decided", "start": 19.359, "end": 19.743}, {"text": "by", "start": 19.755, "end": 19.887}, {"text": "vote", "start": 19.9, "end": 20.272}]}, {"cap": "In tests, the pigeons hit the target really well.", "start": 20.892, "end": 23.428, "audio_at": 20.832, "dur": 2.776041, "words": [{"text": "In", "start": 20.892, "end": 20.976}, {"text": "tests", "start": 20.988, "end": 21.565}, {"text": "the", "start": 21.757, "end": 21.866}, {"text": "pigeons", "start": 21.878, "end": 22.214}, {"text": "hit", "start": 22.226, "end": 22.358}, {"text": "the", "start": 22.37, "end": 22.443}, {"text": "target", "start": 22.455, "end": 22.851}, {"text": "really", "start": 22.863, "end": 23.068}, {"text": "well", "start": 23.08, "end": 23.428}]}, {"cap": "But the generals didn't take the idea seriously.", "start": 23.948, "end": 26.16, "audio_at": 23.888, "dur": 2.451542, "words": [{"text": "But", "start": 23.948, "end": 24.02}, {"text": "the", "start": 24.032, "end": 24.104}, {"text": "generals", "start": 24.116, "end": 24.549}, {"text": "didn't", "start": 24.621, "end": 24.862}, {"text": "take", "start": 24.874, "end": 25.102}, {"text": "the", "start": 25.114, "end": 25.21}, {"text": "idea", "start": 25.222, "end": 25.547}, {"text": "seriously", "start": 25.559, "end": 26.16}]}, {"cap": "The project was canceled in 1944.", "start": 26.68, "end": 28.951, "audio_at": 26.62, "dur": 2.5116249, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 26.68, "end": 26.728}, {"text": "project", "start": 26.74, "end": 27.136}, {"text": "was", "start": 27.148, "end": 27.293}, {"text": "canceled", "start": 27.305, "end": 27.773}, {"text": "in 1944", "start": 27.785, "end": 28.951}]}, {"cap": "Years later, the Navy tried again, under a new name: Project Orcon.", "start": 29.571, "end": 33.994, "audio_at": 29.511, "dur": 4.663042, "words": [{"text": "Years", "start": 29.571, "end": 29.836}, {"text": "later", "start": 29.848, "end": 30.196}, {"text": "the", "start": 30.449, "end": 30.521}, {"text": "Navy", "start": 30.533, "end": 30.845}, {"text": "tried", "start": 30.857, "end": 31.17}, {"text": "again", "start": 31.182, "end": 31.542}, {"text": "under", "start": 31.831, "end": 32.059}, {"text": "a", "start": 32.071, "end": 32.107}, {"text": "new", "start": 32.119, "end": 32.396}, {"text": "name", "start": 32.408, "end": 32.817}, {"text": "Project", "start": 33.057, "end": 33.538}, {"text": "Orcon", "start": 33.55, "end": 33.994}]}, {"cap": "They only gave up for good in 1953, when electronics got good enough.", "start": 34.514, "end": 38.625, "audio_at": 34.454, "dur": 4.350582999999999, "words": [{"text": "They", "start": 34.514, "end": 34.611}, {"text": "only", "start": 34.623, "end": 34.827}, {"text": "gave", "start": 34.839, "end": 35.079}, {"text": "up", "start": 35.091, "end": 35.211}, {"text": "for", "start": 35.223, "end": 35.368}, {"text": "good", "start": 35.38, "end": 35.608}, {"text": "in 1953", "start": 35.62, "end": 36.75}, {"text": "when", "start": 37.062, "end": 37.159}, {"text": "electronics", "start": 37.171, "end": 37.808}, {"text": "got", "start": 37.82, "end": 38.024}, {"text": "good", "start": 38.036, "end": 38.192}, {"text": "enough", "start": 38.204, "end": 38.625}]}, {"cap": "So for a while, the most advanced computer in a bomb… was a pigeon.", "start": 39.245, "end": 43.055, "audio_at": 39.185, "dur": 4.050083, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 39.245, "end": 39.413}, {"text": "for", "start": 39.425, "end": 39.557}, {"text": "a", "start": 39.569, "end": 39.63}, {"text": "while", "start": 39.642, "end": 40.062}, {"text": "the", "start": 40.279, "end": 40.351}, {"text": "most", "start": 40.363, "end": 40.615}, {"text": "advanced", "start": 40.627, "end": 41.036}, {"text": "computer", "start": 41.048, "end": 41.505}, {"text": "in", "start": 41.517, "end": 41.673}, {"text": "a", "start": 41.685, "end": 41.745}, {"text": "bomb", "start": 41.757, "end": 42.202}, {"text": "was", "start": 42.49, "end": 42.61}, {"text": "a", "start": 42.622, "end": 42.67}, {"text": "pigeon", "start": 42.682, "end": 43.055}]}, {"cap": "Would you trust a pigeon? Tell me in the comments.", "start": 43.775, "end": 45.926, "audio_at": 43.715, "dur": 2.391416, "words": [{"text": "Would", "start": 43.775, "end": 43.883}, {"text": "you", "start": 43.895, "end": 43.955}, {"text": "trust", "start": 43.967, "end": 44.196}, {"text": "a", "start": 44.208, "end": 44.244}, {"text": "pigeon", "start": 44.256, "end": 44.568}, {"text": "Tell", "start": 44.965, "end": 45.073}, {"text": "me", "start": 45.085, "end": 45.181}, {"text": "in", "start": 45.193, "end": 45.253}, {"text": "the", "start": 45.265, "end": 45.338}, {"text": "comments", "start": 45.35, "end": 45.926}]}]}